        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Lorsqu’il court, on peut voir de l’électricité se former à la base de sa queue. Ce Pokémon est très populaire auprès des bergers de Galar.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "This Pokémon is very popular as a herding dog in the Galar region. As it runs, it generates electricity from the base of its tail.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "走る　ときに　しっぽの　根元から 電気を　生み出す。　ガラルでは 牧羊犬として　人気。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "おやつに　つられて　ひとの　しごとを てつだう　くいしんぼう。　パチパチと でんきを　まとって　ひたはしる。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja-Hrkt",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/1/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "shield",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/34/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Ce glouton assiste les humains dans leur travail en échange de friandises. Il court sans arrêt, le corps enveloppé d’électricité.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "shield",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/34/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "This gluttonous Pokémon only assists people with their work because it wants treats. As it runs, it crackles with electricity.",
